Worksheet 2: Grammar Practice (Present Simple Tense)
Title: English Worksheet 2 - Grammar Practice
Part A: Complete the sentences
1.  I __________ (go) to school every day.
2.  She __________ (like) Thai food very much.
3.  They __________ (not / play) football on Monday.
4.  My teacher __________ (speak) English very well.
Part B: Make questions
1.  You / like / English class? → ______________________________?
2.  She / live / in Bangkok? → ______________________________?
Part C: Writing Task Write about your daily routine (minimum 8 sentences).
Example: I wake up at 6:30 AM. I eat breakfast…